WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:10.780
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:11.730
Seconds.

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:12.910
Yes, yes.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.800
closed captions

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:15.360
Don't just interrupt and pretend to be a queen.

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:20.580
Marron-chan, if you're that bored, would you want to check out the Human world?

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:26.290
In the past, we were peeking on the Human world, and it was quite interesting, wasn't it?

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:35.490
I guess so. Seeing it again could be fun.

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:38.000
If you're going, then please take us with you.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.460
We have some friends we haven't seen for ages.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:45.870
But you three don't have the Queen's permission to go to the Human world, do you?

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:50.950
That's why we're asking you. You're allowed to take three people with your license, right?

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:55.470
I guess so. I'll take you with me.

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:57.970
Yay! Yes!

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:58.540
In return, you have to be obedient.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.040
OP sequence

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:01.830
If you cause a ruckus, I'll be punished for it, you hear me!?

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:06.360
How boring.

00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:14.150
My Grand Prix is already over, and Makoto-kun seems busy with the finals.

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:17.840
I don't feel like doing anything anymore.

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:30.060
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:30.060
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

