00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:57.570
Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:58.720
It's perfect!

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:20.290
How boring.

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:21.980
Huh? What?

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:25.980
I was alone with Makoto-kun, and why was I bored!?

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:27.420
That's impossible!

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:30.880
Makoto-kun...

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:40.570
Hey, Makoto-kun. What should I do?

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:43.000
Miya's Grand Prix is already over.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.950
All my excuses to see Makoto-kun have vanished...

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:53.390
Everyone says it's all right just to go and see him, but...

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:55.170
...is it fine to just meet someone out of love?

00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:00.010
Really!? I'm so happy~

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:06.030
recipe 34

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:06.030
The Greatest Pair in History<i>!</i>

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:10.540
Wee! So refreshing~

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.540
Yahoo!

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:12.730
Caramel will do it too!

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.890
Sheesh, what's up with you!?

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:21.470
That's what you get for jumping with the swim ring on.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:24.810
Chocolat!

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:26.870
Vanilla, wait!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:27.900
What's wrong?

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.030
Something's coming!

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:31.040
W-What is this!?

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.040
I'm scared!

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:38.660
Yo!

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:40.440
How are you?

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.500
We haven't met since the Surprise Sweets event.

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:43.470
Move it!

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:46.170
What did you do that for, Chocolat?

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:47.860
That's what I want to ask you!

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:50.540
Shut up! You bitter chocolate sprit!

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.390
What was that!?

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.330
Try to chase me!

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:56.720
Wait for me, Kashi!

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:58.000
Bitter chocolate!

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.610
Now I'm mad!

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:03.320
When those two meet, this always happen, doesn't it?

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.710
Well, it looks like fun so that's fine right?

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:09.670
So true. Even though Chocolat is mad, her face still has that smile to it.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:12.550
By the way, why did you three come here?

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:15.520
Did you receive permission to come to the Human world?

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:16.640
Well, that's...

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:18.160
How do I say it...

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.630
I brought them with me.

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:22.000
Marron!

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:27.020
I see! So Marron is finally looking for a partner, huh?

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:31.150
There are a lot of humans fitting to be your partner here!

00:05:31.150 --> 00:05:34.780
I know that. I saw them during the Cake Grand Prix.

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:38.520
As I thought, the one peeking from the window was Marron, wasn't it?

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.420
Welcome back, Chocolat.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:41.020
Marron!

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:43.520
We've seen each other before, haven't we?

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.110
I met a human that fits you perfectly.

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:49.250
She looks down on people, just like you, Marron.

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:52.050
You'll definitely be interested! Let's go look for one right away.

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:52.710
Let's go!

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:58.650
Well, if everyone says so, I guess I can look for one.

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:01.790
Umm... Ojou's class is supposed to be somewhere around here...

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:07.880
What's wrong, Ojou-sama? You were so cheerful earlier today.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:10.810
Right now we're in the middle of class. Please wake up.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:16.910
Yohko has found out some new information on Kashino.
With that, you can get another idea to approach him.

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:17.520
It's perfect!

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:21.610
What's this? How does she resemble me?

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.760
She's just a good-for-nothing human, isn't she?

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:27.550
Usually she's far more lively and self-confident.

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:32.040
It seems like after she lost in the Cake Grand Prix, her motivation disappeared.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:37.980
What a loser. Just by losing once she loses all her motivation. No thanks.

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:40.780
Well, whatever. I'll find a partner on my own.

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:41.460
Marron!

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:47.340
Everyone seems normal. I can't feel anyone special.

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.550
W-What's up with this blinding aura!?

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:56.600
Amazing. She's so rhythmical.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:59.270
Just like singing a song...

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:01.730
...or dancing.

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:05.220
How can she be so delicate and beautiful?

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:07.990
Is this a student's technique?

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:10.880
A pro? No, she's beyond a pro!

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:14.840
I've decided! I'll make this girl my partner...

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:14.840
Wonderful, Marie.

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:18.000
The Kingdom of Sweets' Queen will be happy with this.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.200
H-Honey-sama?

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:23.990
As expected of Honey-sama. She has good eyes, just like me.

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:25.720
Magical macaron.

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:27.620
Sweets Romance Card.

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:29.270
Come out!

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:41.720
I found quite a lot of fitting humans, but everyone already has a Spirit with them.

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:43.700
Am I too late, I wonder?

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:50.210
Don't laugh so hard! I imaged it just like this...

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:55.610
W-What's with the soumen? If you want something bitter, you could just cut some chocolate!

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:57.580
I'll be crafting some sweets instead.

00:07:58.090 --> 00:08:01.540
Mama sent me some soumen, and it was just about to expire...

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:05.220
Even though, it's not easy to come up with a way to use soumen, you know.

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:08.520
Andou's so kind! I love you!

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:13.050
It's because you're too soft on her that she ended up with this charcoal-like topping!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:17.340
Everyone makes mistakes! If she does it right the next time, it'll be fine.

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:19.860
There is no next time in the Grand Prix!

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:23.610
I see there are people with lots of ideas, but lack the technique.

00:08:23.610 --> 00:08:26.210
Having such a partner is just awful.

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:28.740
Vanilla has such a partner!

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:31.900
Oh, really? That really suits you, Vanilla.

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:36.510
But with such a partner, aiming to become a top-ranked pâtissière will just remain as a dream.

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:38.820
Marron, you just don't know anything about Ichigo!

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:43.940
Ichigo has the ability and strength to practice hard every day!

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:46.860
Oh? But it doesn't look like that to me at all.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:48.520
What was that!?

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:51.110
Hey, hey, fighting is not good at all.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:55.480
Besides, aren't you just stupid for choosing a partner from middle school?

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:57.250
I'll pick one from high school...

00:08:57.250 --> 00:09:00.670
Eh? Is that a Mont Blanc from a middle schooler?

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:03.480
I've decided! I'm making this person my partner-

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:06.850
Too bad for you! Kashino is my partner.

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:08.710
Really?

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:11.020
Oh, this guy is also quite...

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:13.950
I'm sorry, but Satsuki is <i>my</i>  partner.

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:15.760
Oh? This one-

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:19.780
Don't! Andou is Caramel's partner!

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:22.440
You don't have to cry...

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:25.830
I get it! I won't pick a partner from this class.

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:29.840
It's here! It's big too!

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:33.000
Just a bit more...

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:57.820
There seems to be no more fitting partners for me here.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:05.320
Just as you said, Yohko. Since it's inevitable that Makoto-kun will lose to Team Tennouji,

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:08.620
winning the Grand Prix to go to Paris is just a child's dream.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.640
Nothing is impossible for the Global Château confectionery!

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:11.710
Precisely.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:12.380
It's perfect!

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:17.320
After I borrow some money from Papa, I'll just take Makoto-kun with me to Paris in a private jet.

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:18.590
<i>That girl must be...</i>

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:33.650
<i>To be on a date alone in Paris with Makoto-kun... Miya is the world's...</i>

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:37.030
<i>No, the universe's happiest girl.</i>

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:45.540
<i>Makoto-kun, why do you keep looking into my eyes like that?</i>

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:51.080
<i>I saw the night view of Paris reflected in your eyes.</i>

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:57.920
<i>Your lips... are sweeter than any chocolate.</i>

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:01.310
<i>Makoto-kun...</i>

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:07.430
Oh, Makoto-kun! So da-ri-ng!

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:11.990
Okay! I'll go together with Makoto-kun on a lovey-dovey time in Paris!

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:15.660
What's with that girl?

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:17.910
But I feel she's something amazing.

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:23.160
It's something I don't know, but I feel motivated again!

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:27.820
If it comes to this, I can defeat Chocolat and the others and have a lovey-dovey time with one of those handsome guys-

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:28.980
Not that!

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:30.370
I'll make her my partner, you'll see!

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:32.600
Chocolat, we're going.

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:33.920
Okay.

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.040
Wait a minute.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.730
W-What?

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:37.720
Kashino-kun.

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:41.180
Marron! Didn't you return to the Kingdom of Sweets?

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:42.500
Chocolat, do you know her?

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:45.260
I'll replace Chocolat and become your partner.

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:50.210
What nonsense are you spouting!?

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:54.830
If you partner up with me, you will be able to win the Cake Grand Prix easily.

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:56.720
Having Chocolat as my partner is plentiful.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:57.280
Eh?

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:03.770
Did you hear that!? My bonds and Kashino's are really deep.

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:07.940
Deep bonds, huh. What about showing some proof of that?

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:14.620
T-There are things that I know about Kashino, like <i>this</i>  and <i>that</i>.

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:15.830
What the heck do you know about me!?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.950
Let's hear it.

00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:23.890
For example, he's really good at drawing, but his handwriting sucks!

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:26.570
What's with those worm-like lines?

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:28.220
There's something more horrible...

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.970
The handsome guy's other side, huh?

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:35.400
He's not just any handsome guy, though! He's a totally ruthless one!

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:36.550
Anything else?

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:39.850
He has a terrible sleeping posture, so his hair is always messed up in the morning.

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:43.890
Every morning he spends at least 30 minutes in front of mirror to fix his hair.

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:45.700
3-30 minutes?

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:48.220
If you're surprised by that, you're naïve.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:49.210
There's still more?

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:51.350
Yes! It's a <i>big</i>  secret!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:52.260
What secret!?

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:55.020
On Kashino's right butt cheek...

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:58.110
...there's a cute little mole!

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.090
Why do you know even that!?

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:04.460
One day, when you were taking a bath, I saw it by accident.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:05.820
You were just peeping!

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:07.600
That's just a coincidence!

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:10.440
For a partner to know even such things...

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:12.140
I lose.

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:13.120
Huh?

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:17.040
I'll give up on Kashino-kun.

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:19.650
I'll go with Hanabusa-kun. Where is he?

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:24.650
Sha-la-la-la-la-la, looking into love...

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:24.650
Sha-la-la-la-la-la, ai no shirabe

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:29.990
I play my heart...

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:29.990
kanaderu no boku no HAATO

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:34.670
Don't cry, rose maiden.

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:34.670
Naka naide, bara no otome

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:41.940
Drowned in tears...

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:41.940
Namida ni obore

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:47.590
Smile, look!

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:47.590
Hohoende goran, hora

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:52.600
Tears of rain, quiet love.

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:52.600
Ame namida, ai no shizuku

00:13:52.600 --> 00:14:02.580
My heart is reflected in the mirror. The world is tender-hearted.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:14:02.580
Boku no kokoro kagami ni utsushi. Sekai wa mono

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:07.500
Sha-la-la-la-la-la, there is only one love.

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:07.500
Sha-la-la-la-la-la, ai wa hitotsu

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:12.640
Grab my heart.

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:12.640
Tsukamaete boku no HAATO

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:17.680
You are my one and only, rose maiden...

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:17.680
Kimi dake sa bara no otome

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:14.620
It stinks.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:17.680
Roses have a nice fragrance, don't they?

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:27.580
The murmured sound by the light.

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:27.580
Hikari de sasaya oto

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:20.490
Because it's a rose bath, after all.

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:25.350
Besides, for a lady to intrude into an occupied bathroom...

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:27.580
Aren't you ashamed?

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:32.530
Well, I can understand the feeling of wanting to see ourselves among the roses.

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:35.210
Let's overlook it, Cafe-kun.

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:37.890
It's a sin that the two of us are so beautiful.

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:42.790
That doesn't matter at all. Hanabusa-kun, become my new partner.

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:43.820
With you?

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:51.660
To have two Sweets Spirits around, that doesn't sound bad. Yeah, sure.

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:53.510
You agreed so quickly.

00:14:53.510 --> 00:15:01.060
Normally it's only one Sweets Spirit per human, but if Satsuki agrees to it then I won't object.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.300
Is it really fine?

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:04.110
With that settled...

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:10.710
It's just natural that Andou is Caramel's partner!

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:14.660
Some clumsy Spirit like you doesn't fit with Andou-kun at all.

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:16.850
How about it? If you become partners with me,

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:21.100
you'll become a better pâtissier than the devilish Kashino-kun and the narcissistic Hanabusa-kun.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.740
No way...

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:26.330
Caramel and I share a very deep bond.

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:28.100
There is no place for you.

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:29.510
What?

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:34.830
I'm so happy you think that way, since all I ever do is hold you back.

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.430
That's not true.

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:39.650
You've saved me countless times with your smile.

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:41.960
I'm so happy.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:45.130
I... really need you.

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.880
Andou~

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.220
Nooo!!!

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:06.450
What's up with the Japanese St. Marie boarding school?

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:10.490
As I thought, if I want to look for a partner, I should do that in the main campus in Paris.

00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:14.410
I guess I'll go back to the Kingdom of Sweets first.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:16.780
Umm, I'm pretty sure it was the first oven.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:21.330
Oh, if it isn't Marron?

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:24.220
Did you finally get interested in finding a partner?

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:30.240
Well, I guess. But there is no fitting human for me here.

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:32.880
No partner coming even near Honey-sama's level.

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:34.770
You're pretty strict.

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:39.260
For once, there were three cute boys in the middle school that caught my eye, but...

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:44.420
The Sweets Princes have Chocolat and the others following them.

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:48.130
I have no choice. I'll go to the main campus in Paris to search now.

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:49.900
Well then, pardon me.

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:51.720
There you are!

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:52.620
Koshiro-san?

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:56.620
So you were here, President. I've searched everywhere for you.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:57.900
Do you have business with me?

00:16:57.900 --> 00:16:59.720
This is a declaration to you again!

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:02.850
I've been studying hard to become a first-rate pâtissière until now.

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:07.750
But now I'm going to become a super-super-super-super first-rate pâtissière and surpass you, just watch!

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:11.010
That sounds really good.

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:14.270
W-What? What's with that confident reaction...

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:16.830
Well, that doesn't matter. Just watch me.

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:19.550
I'll ask Papa a favor and go to Paris with Makoto-kun!

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:23.590
You'll see that we'll become the world's greatest pâtissier and pâtissière!

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:29.030
So that's what it was about.

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:31.860
But will Kashino-kun be happy with that?

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:34.510
Eh? What!? Makoto-kun-

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:39.710
Kashino-kun wants to beat me in the Cake Grand Prix and to go to Paris.

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:45.320
He wants to become a true pâtissier, and fight for it seriously, do you think he will be happy with that?

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:49.480
That's right. Even if you use your money, he'll just turn it down, won't he?

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:51.790
W-Who was that speaking?

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:54.630
That girl can hear a Spirit's voice.

00:17:55.460 --> 00:17:58.220
That kind of advice is just ridiculous.

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:01.640
I'll do <i>anything</i>  to obtain the one I love!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.990
I'll use <i>anything</i>  that is usable!

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:07.830
Because that's Koshiro Miya's lovey-dovey power!

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:14.050
Oh my! I think I got love in my eyes...

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:14.960
I'm fond of you.

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:15.450
Eh?

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:20.570
Koshiro Miya. I'll make you and your almost irritating power of love my partner.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:22.750
What's this tiny thing?

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:24.520
I'm a Sweets Spirit, Marron.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:27.740
A Sweets Spirit, you say!?

00:18:27.740 --> 00:18:31.370
You really exist! I thought it was just a legend...

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:35.990
If you become my partner, I'll make your dreams come true.

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:36.930
Really?

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:39.740
Of course! Nice to meet you, Miya.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:43.200
Isn't that great, Marron.

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.960
Oh! The President also has a Sweets Spirit!?

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:47.040
Her name's Honey-sama.

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:53.150
Oh, so that's how it is. Since you have a Sweets Spirit with you, no wonder I lost.

00:18:54.540 --> 00:19:00.480
Somehow I got my energy back. With Marron as my new partner, I won't lose to you!

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:02.040
I'm looking forward to it.

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:04.560
That self-confidence of yours won't last for long!

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:07.820
Marron, we're going to the middle school cooking classroom to make some sweets!

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:08.470
Sure!

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:15.730
Since your name means "chestnut" in French, I was
thinking of making Mont Blanc with plenty of chestnuts.

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:17.750
What should we do for the base?

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:19.480
How about a financier?

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:22.000
A financier? Okay.

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:25.700
Leave the marron glacé to me. It's my specialty.

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:27.460
Well then, let's begin.

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:27.890
Yes!

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:30.370
Oh, so something like that happened.

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:34.900
It was dangerous! Marron tried to take my place as Andou's partner.

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:38.150
Huh? The light's on... I wonder if someone's practicing?

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:42.160
Wow, it's Mont Blancs! They look delicious!

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:44.630
These are quite well-made.

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:45.950
Who did these, I wonder?

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:49.210
It doesn't matter, they should at least wash their dishes.

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:54.780
Makoto-kun! Nice timing. I just finished making my Mont Blancs!

00:19:54.780 --> 00:19:56.180
Ojou did these!?

00:19:56.180 --> 00:19:57.780
Eat them.

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.830
Delicious!

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:04.790
The financier has been cooked perfectly.

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:06.690
The marron cream is flawless, too!

00:20:06.690 --> 00:20:08.560
When did your skills raise this much?

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:13.040
It's true!

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:15.100
Delicious!

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:16.420
Fantastic!

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:17.950
Not bad, Ojou.

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:20.710
Did all of you have Sweets Spirits accompanying you?

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:22.820
Koshiro-san, can you see them!?

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:28.620
Actually, I also have a Sweets Spirit partner with me.

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:29.980
Eh!?

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:31.140
Come out.

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:32.910
Marron!

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:35.510
Didn't you give up and go back home?

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:39.220
Geez, Marron! I knew you'd become Ojou's partner.

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:42.640
We're connected by the red thread of fate.

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:47.590
Now that I'm her partner, I'll make sure that Miya's dream will come true!

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:49.570
That's how it is.

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:53.030
So becoming the most suitable pâtissière for you is just a matter of time!

00:20:53.030 --> 00:20:55.150
When that time comes, let's get married!

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:11.260
Marron, don't leave us here!

00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:13.320
What'll happen if the Queen finds out?

00:21:13.320 --> 00:21:15.960
Come back, Marron-chan!

