The French baked sweet - Financier.

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:18.820
It is a baked sweet that's made up of almond powder, hazelnut butter, albumen, sugar and wheat flour baked together.

00:23:18.820 --> 00:23:23.890
Especially that the almond powder is what gives its taste.

00:23:23.890 --> 00:23:27.670
And what do you think its shape resembles?

00:23:29.500 --> 00:23:32.960
Yes! It looks exactly like gold bars!

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:36.720
Actually, Financier is rumoured to have derived its name...

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:45.010
...because it was popular amongst financial people and capitalists or that its shape and colour resembles a gold bar.

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:49.620
When you eat Financier, you feel like you're a rich person, right?

00:23:50.820 --> 00:23:55.500
The application period for the Princess Battle Sweets Party is closing soon.

00:23:55.500 --> 00:23:58.530
Everyone, buy the merchandise and send them in, okay?

00:24:00.640 --> 00:24:03.240
No way! Henri-sensei is just in front of my eyes!

00:24:03.240 --> 00:24:04.200
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:06.190
It hurts, that means it isn't a dream!?

00:24:06.190 --> 00:24:08.280
It's not a dream, this is reality!

00:24:08.280 --> 00:24:09.650
Ow, ow, ow, ow! Huh?

00:24:09.650 --> 00:24:11.290
Henri-sensei, where are you going?

00:24:11.290 --> 00:24:12.490
It really is... a dream!

00:24:12.490 --> 00:24:13.450
Ow, ow, ow!

00:24:13.450 --> 00:24:15.350
When will you stop this gag?

00:24:15.350 --> 00:24:16.120
It's Henri-sensei!

00:24:16.120 --> 00:24:18.810
Henri-sensei~

00:24:18.810 --> 00:24:20.710
Next episode, Welcome, Henri-sensei.

00:24:20.710 --> 00:24:23.090
